**Not included:** building Kroll, Rx/inventory/billing modules, unattended 100% automation (human approve on failures).

**One-line quote:** *Automation app on existing Kroll — **6–8 weeks to pilot** with 2 devs and Cursor AI; **8–12 weeks** with UAT and IT deploy buffer.*
